  "limits": [
    "Native glute/underside views use the saved Athlete proportions. Other female/male bodies have numeric coverage, not exhaustive visual or wardrobe coverage.",
    "The before face captures retain the saved hair because the initial body-normalized patch omitted cosmetic fields; they are diagnostic rather than exact pixel comparisons. Final face captures explicitly use bald hair and natural skin.",
    "The baseline rear camera cropped the lower body; final rear views use wider framing. Pose/skin metrics provide corresponding before/after measurements.",
